ession_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%ZSTD,zstd,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%Pack&lt;space&gt;Bits,pack-bits,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%CCITT&lt;space&gt;RLE,ccitt-rle,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%CCITT&lt;space&gt;FAX3,ccitt-fax3,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%CCITT&lt;space&gt;FAX4,ccitt-fax4,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error%LERC,lerc,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level%LERC&lt;space&gt;DEFLATE,lerc_deflate,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_zstd_compression_level%LERC&lt;space&gt;ZSTD,lerc_zstd,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level%None,none,geotiff_jpeg_compression_level,geotiff_deflate_compression_level,geotiff_lerc_max_z_error Compression Method&quot; none &quot;GUI RANGE_SLIDER_OR_ATTR geotiff_jpeg_compression_level 0%100%0%OFF JPEG Compression Level (0 - 100)&quot; 25 &quot;GUI RANGE_SLIDER_OR_ATTR geotiff_deflate_compression_level 1%9%0%OFF DEFLATE Compression Level (1 - 9)&quot; 6 &quot;GUI RANGE_SLIDER_OR_ATTR geotiff_zstd_compression_level 1%22%0%OFF ZSTD Compression Level (1 - 22)&quot; 9 &quot;GUI RANGE_SLIDER_OR_ATTR geotiff_lerc_max_z_error 0%MAX%MAX%OFF LERC Error Tolerance&quot; 0 &quot;GUI CHOICE_OR_ATTR geotiff_tab_file_generation yes%no Generate TAB File&quot; no &quot;GUI OPTIONAL INTEGER_OR_ATTR geotiff_number_of_bits_per_cell Number of Bits per Cell (1 - 32)&quot; &quot;&quot; &quot;GUI CHOICE_OR_ATTR geotiff_enable_bigtiff yes%no Enable BigTIFF&quot; no &quot;GUI CHOICE_OR_ATTR geotiff_interleaving_type BSQ%BIP Interleaving Type&quot; 